WEBVTT

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:37.880
Episode 5    Just the Way You Are

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:38.910
My minions.

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.150
Have you steeled yourselves?

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:58.930
Then I shall now present the 
Princess Series monthly reports!

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:02.540
You have been evaluated on combat outcomes,
 negative energy accumulation,

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:05.180
drive, enthusiasm, et cetera.

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:08.690
First on the overall leaderboard is...

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:12.690
Bear's team once again in a landslide!

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:17.180
<b>Reaper Princess</b>

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:17.180
<b>Beast Princess</b>

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:17.180
Their streak of breakaway leads over 
the second-place finisher continues!

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:21.930
Reaper Princess is also very 
aggressive in suggesting plans,

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:24.450
and she has a perfect 
combat attendance record.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:27.050
Truly, she is a role model for evil!

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:32.030
Beating Red half to death the other 
day also earned her big points.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:34.590
You could all learn a thing or two from her!

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:38.570
Reaper-san is very impressive.

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:39.840
Grr...

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:42.410
Could we have a word about 
your first-place ranking?

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.090
I'm very pleased.

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:50.680
And to celebrate your achievement, 
you receive a Super Bosslar-kun Doll!

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.140
This ain't gonna stand!

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:57.690
You think you can outshine me 
every single damned time...

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:00.190
Let's settle this, Reaper Princess! You and me!

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:01.400
Please calm down.

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:03.070
You can have this, if you want.

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:04.730
I don't want the damned thing!

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:04.850
<b>thonk</b>

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:17.800
<b>Cafeteria</b>

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:29.180
Here you are! One pasta set!

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:31.580
Stupid Reaper.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:33.190
I'll show her soon enough.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:35.940
Next time, I'm gonna be number one!

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:38.770
I suppose we'll see.

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:40.690
Shut your hole, last-placer!

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:42.700
And what's that crap you're eatin'?

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:43.950
Pickled sea cucumber.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.450
What the hell is wrong with you?

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:48.070
<i>Beast Princess...</i>

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:50.570
<i>She appears to have some 
kind of grudge against me.</i>

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:53.580
<i>She hates losing, and suffers 
from violent mood swings.</i>

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:55.920
<i>Steel Princess.</i>

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.090
<i>She seems to exist in her own little world.</i>

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:01.590
<i>She's uncompetitive, 
and she's hard to get a handle on.</i>

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.190
Would you like a bite?

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:03.970
Hell no!

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:06.190
<i>They're a fun little duo.</i>

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.130
Would you hear me out, Beast-san?

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:10.830
I have something on my mind.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:14.340
The truth is...

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:17.480
I've fallen in love with someone.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:19.590
Like I give a damn.

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:21.240
Don't come to me with crap like that.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.030
You can tell me all about it!

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:24.490
Butt out, Reaper!

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:28.020
You're in love? That's fabulous, Steel!

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:30.870
Reaper-san, are you interested 
in people's love lives?

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.710
D-Didn't think you were the type...

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.740
So? What kind of person are they?

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:40.820
Terribly wild, yet very understanding.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.440
<b>Mmm</b>

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:44.430
No one wants to see a Reaper 
make that stupid, goofy expression!

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:49.030
But this person is technically a co-worker.

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:50.930
Hang on, you kiddin' me?

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:53.800
Workplace romances are off-limits.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:54.940
Give it up already.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.760
I know that my feelings are wrong.

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:02.190
Yet... I cannot stop myself.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:04.540
Followin' the rules comes first.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:06.350
Tell her, Reaper.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:07.810
I understand.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:11.230
I completely understand how you feel, Steel!

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:11.160
<b>squee</b>

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.200
<b>squee</b>

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:12.200
Hey!

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:13.900
Who cares if it's against the rules?

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:15.960
I'll do everything I can to support you!

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:18.290
What's got you so enthusiastic?

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:19.920
Thank you, Reaper-san!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.630
I said you can't do it!

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:24.980
Okay, Steel. What do you want to do next?

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:26.970
It's like they don't even hear me!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:32.440
I'd like to tell this person how I feel.

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.290
Yeah, that sounds right!

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:36.980
You can't get anywhere until they know!

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:40.230
What's wrong?

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:51.690
I'm absent-minded, plain, and a poor worker.

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:57.080
I possess no qualities considered 
appealing in a woman.

00:05:57.610 --> 00:06:02.590
There's no way this person 
would ever return my feelings.

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:12.060
Don't think that way, Steel.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.070
I know you can make that confession!

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.940
But how?

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.060
With femininity!

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:20.890
We'll help your develop your femininity,

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:23.690
and give you the courage to 
tell this person how you feel!

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:26.440
Soldiers in an evil army 
don't need femininity!

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:29.450
Do you think I can do it?

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.580
Of course you can!

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:33.200
Don't worry. I'll help you!

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.840
Reaper-san...

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:38.970
I will try!

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:44.880
<b>Cafeteria</b>

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:40.140
That's the spirit!

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:41.690
Let's do our best, all three of us!

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:43.880
Since when am I a part of this?!

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:54.230
Hey...

00:06:56.940 --> 00:06:57.860
Hey.

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:00.390
Hey!

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:03.680
Pilates are great for your mental 
and physical well-being.

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:05.050
You have to concentrate, Beast!

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:07.240
I told you, I ain't part of this!

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:08.400
How are you feeling, Steel?

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:11.660
Okay, next up!

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:21.170
<b>Terror</b>

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:21.170
Next up...

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.920
<b>The Beautiful Manners of Maturity</b>

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:29.670
<b>Femininity</b>

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:32.430
Next up.

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:41.440
Next up!

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:52.140
This exercise will develop your 
core muscles, giving you a great figure!

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.170
H-Hey, are you okay?

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:56.710
I've had enough.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:01.960
These exercises have only served 
to confirm how worthless I am.

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:07.960
I will give up on love.

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:12.150
Thank you for trying your best for me.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:14.860
Hey, now.

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:17.360
I think you made her feel 
even worse about herself.

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:18.750
Steel...

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.020
I'll get you this time!

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:25.810
Charge!

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:39.240
I see.

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:42.910
Sounds like you've been working really 
hard to help your friend, Desumi-san.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:45.770
Steel is just like I was.

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:48.550
No confidence in herself at all.

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:53.180
But I ended up getting ahead
of myself and hurting her instead.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:58.500
I guess telling someone how you feel and 
getting them to date you isn't that easy.

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:02.390
Hey, Fudo...

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:05.190
What do you expect out of 
your significant other?

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:06.720
Nothing in particular.

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:07.860
Nothing?

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:11.190
As long as you're by my side, 
that's good enough for me.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:14.130
S-Stupid!

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:15.560
There has to be something!

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:17.690
Don't you want me to be 
a good cook or anything?

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:18.460
There isn't.

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:21.700
I like you just the way you are.

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:29.470
H-Honestly... you're hopeless, Fudo.

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:33.210
Thank you, Fudo.

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:35.720
I'm a very lucky girl.

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:38.430
I just hope I helped.

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:41.340
Yeah. You really did, Fudo.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:48.030
I forgot about something very important.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:51.730
<b>Steel Princess
 Dressing Room</b>

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:51.730
We're coming in, Steel.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:08.790
<b>Iron Labyrinth</b>

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:12.790
She's been holed up like this a whole day now.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:16.040
When she gets like this, 
she refuses to budge,

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.800
and it gets dangerous to approach.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.970
Stupid! Don't provoke her!

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:25.220
Her shell's system 
counterattacks automaticall!

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:28.230
Listen to me, Steel!

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:30.170
I was wrong.

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:32.610
You never had to change!

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:35.340
It's okay to have things you're not good at!

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:37.020
You should be just the way you are!

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:39.360
Be the Steel that we know!

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:06.060
So, please, Steel...

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:14.310
Don't give up on love.

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:18.150
Just the way I am?

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:22.950
You didn't really give up, did you?

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:27.770
I didn't.

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:32.940
You didn't really want to 
deny your feelings of love.

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:36.600
I didn't, Reaper-san.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:39.460
Sheesh, what a pain in the ass.

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:41.870
Thank you, you two.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:44.470
You've given me the courage I need.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:48.030
I know that I'm incompetent,

00:11:48.030 --> 00:11:49.980
and completely lacking in appeal...

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.590
But that's just

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:56.680
the way I am!

00:11:57.890 --> 00:12:00.220
I'm going to tell that person how I feel!

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:06.490
<b>Eensy-weensy</b>

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:06.490
Eensy-weensy!

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:09.240
I'm gonna beat the shit outta you!

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:11.500
I hope that person blows you off!

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:15.250
Hang on... <i>he's</i> the one she's confessing to?!

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:18.500
And they're allowed to date?!

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:20.400
This is totally against the rules.

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:22.060
Every one of you, I swear...

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:26.990
I'm so happy for you, Steel!

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:33.400
Love After World Domination!

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:43.880
I'm grateful for this food.

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:57.750
It's on me.

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:58.910
Eat up.

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.230
You mean it?

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:04.510
That super-duper nice! Thanks tons, man!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:07.510
In exchange, I have a favor to ask you.

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:09.470
Yeah, yeah.

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:10.700
I figured.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:12.470
Sure thing, gotcha.

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:16.420
Allow me to borrow Steel Princess.

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:18.100
Steel Princess?

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:27.460
Sure thing!

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:28.640
Y-You mean it?

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:29.700
Totally, dude.

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:32.490
But she's pretty frickin' stupid. You sure?

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:34.570
Don't you say that about her!

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:35.420
Hang on, hang on!

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:38.000
You're scary when you blow up like that!

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:47.470
Take this, Gelato 5!

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:50.040
Waves of Love Attack!

00:13:56.730 --> 00:14:00.230
Hang on! What's Steel Princess doing here?

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:02.670
I thought she was on a different squad!

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:04.230
What's going on here?

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:04.230
The power of love!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:07.240
We don't have a choice. 
I've got to call Red back!

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.990
Red-san isn't here!

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:15.680
B-But... I was sure he came this way...

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:16.690
He didn't!

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:19.710
But if you insist on coming this way...

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:22.380
You'll have to beat me first!

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.210
Quoi?!

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:27.190
This is like a bad dream.

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:37.060
<i>Praise me! Praise me! Praise me!</i>

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:35.870
<b>Praise me</b>

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:36.580
<b>Praise me</b>

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:37.060
<b>Praise me</b>

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:38.690
T-Thanks.

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:40.440
We appreciate it, Haru.

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.020
Oh, I know, Fudo.

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:51.250
Are you hungry?

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:57.750
You made us lunch, Desumi-san!

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.010
Mother!

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:02.210
Thank you for bringing me into this 
world in the same era as Desumi-san!

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.250
<b><i>Shove</i></b>

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.250
It's really not that big a deal!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:05.710
Let's eat—

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:07.180
Wait, Fudo!

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:08.210
What?

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:11.020
According to the specialist 
texts I consulted,

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:13.600
when couples eat together,

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:17.850
they're supposed to... feed each other.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:20.770
<b>F
E
E
D
!!!</b>

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:20.770
<i>Feed each other!</i>

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:23.110
Oh, I've heard of this!

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:25.230
At last, I'll get to see it done!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:28.690
God above, thank you for creating this world!

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:30.610
<b><i>Shove</i></b>

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:30.610
C'mon, cut it out!

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:34.780
I feel like we're at about 
the stage to try it.

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:37.870
Agreed. Let's advance to that next step.

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:48.340
H-Here it comes, Fudo!

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:50.840
Bring it on, Desumi-san!

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:55.030
O-Open wide!

00:15:57.430 --> 00:16:01.740
O-Opening wide...

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:15.320
What is... happening?

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:17.280
What is it, Fudo?

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:22.290
My stomach hurts... like it's
 never hurt before!

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:23.540
What did you say?!

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:26.560
<b>Heave</b>

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:27.560
<b>Heave</b>

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.130
Oh, come on!

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:28.560
<b>Heave</b>

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.550
This is no time for that!

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:29.550
<b>Heave</b>

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:33.470
These could be my last breaths...

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:34.930
Quickly!

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:37.930
I don't want to feed you this way!

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:42.150
And so... I die.

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.590
F-Fudo!

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:49.310
Haru! Emergency!

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:57.700
<b>3
Days
 Later</b>

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:57.700
<b>Machino Hospital</b>

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:03.710
<b>Dear Red Gelato,

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:01.950
His doctor said he can go home tomorrow.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:03.710
That's such a relief, Senpai!

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:09.070
But I guess appendicitis can take 
out even the toughest among us.

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:10.710
I'm so sorry for all the trouble.

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.510
Now, none of that.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:13.720
Just rest for now.

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:15.160
I peeled you an apple.

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:16.250
Want some?

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:18.470
Thanks, Misaki-neesan.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.140
Open wide!

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:22.600
Opening wide...

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:28.150
O-Open wide!

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:32.150
<i>No! Desumi-san must be 
the first woman to feed me!</i>

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:35.550
The heck are you doing, Fudo?

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:37.320
Open your mouth already!

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:40.340
Stop playing around and eat it already!

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:46.750
<b>Chomp</b>

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:46.200
You're both acting crazy!

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:49.250
Haru-kun!

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:52.760
Goodbye for now. Take care, Fudo-kun.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:54.600
Yes, sir. I will.

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:55.760
See you!

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:59.640
<b>Inpatient Building
Examination Room</b>

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:08.480
Now, Fudo, open wide!

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:11.210
<i>Desumi-san...</i>

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:15.280
<i>Opening wide!</i>

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:16.350
I brought apples!

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:17.530
<i>That was close!</i>

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:19.610
Eh? What was close?

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:21.780
Oh... nothing, Mom.

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:23.330
I brought you a change of clothes.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.790
Oh, thank you.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:27.790
I'll leave the apples here, 
so you can eat them later.

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.220
Well, I have volleyball 
with my women's group!

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.100
Sure.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:37.000
<i>This must be some kind of karmic retribution.</i>

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:41.470
<i>All right.</i>

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.700
Don't do anything stupid, Fudo.

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:47.850
You'll pop your stitches.

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:49.050
Desumi-san!

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:51.790
I heard they're letting you out tomorrow,

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:55.020
but I wanted to see you while you
 were in this unusual situation...

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:56.960
<b>squee</b>

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:57.330
<i>Oh so cute...</i>

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:57.860
<b>Oh so cute...</b>

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.340
You seem to be feeling a lot better now.

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:01.820
The color's back in your face, too.

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:06.330
I'd never die until I let you feed me!

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:08.100
<b>Shove</b>

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:08.100
<b>Shove</b>

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:09.750
Don't talk big, Mr. Appendicitis!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:11.330
You're hitting my stitches!

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:15.450
Honestly, you're just so silly.

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:33.260
Here, Fudo...

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:34.560
To celebrate your recovery.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:44.070
Open wide!

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:46.300
Opening wide...

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:03.400
H-H-How did you like it?

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:06.590
No food since the dawn of civilization 
has ever been so delicious!

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:14.990
Fudo...

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:16.510
Desumi-san...

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.510
I just remembered, Fudo!

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:23.070
Your father's coming to pick you 
up in his mini truck tomorrow!

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:23.880
The mood!

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:25.070
Oh, is this a friend of yours?

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.530
Can you play volleyball?

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:28.030
We need more players to fill the team!

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.070
Come, come, come, come!

00:20:29.070 --> 00:20:30.680
The mood!

00:22:13.230 --> 00:22:14.600
Desumi-san!

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:19.980
<b>Sudden Death Seniors</b>

00:22:27.710 --> 00:22:30.070
You were such a big help today, Desumi-chan.

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:31.970
It was my pleasure!

00:22:31.970 --> 00:22:33.650
Call me any time you need me.

00:22:33.650 --> 00:22:35.240
You know I will.

00:22:35.240 --> 00:22:37.210
But I'm sorry for what I did earlier.

00:22:38.430 --> 00:22:40.210
I know you were in the middle of feeding him.

00:22:43.310 --> 00:22:45.150
A-Actually, I was...

00:22:45.150 --> 00:22:46.620
No need to be shy.

00:22:45.480 --> 00:22:48.670
<b><i>Pat</i></b>

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:48.670
<b><i>Pat</i></b>

00:22:46.620 --> 00:22:48.670
I did the same thing with 
my man back in the day!

00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:52.680
Despite what you might think, I used 
to be a real looker back in the day.

00:22:52.680 --> 00:22:53.790
Want to see?

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:03.020
S-So cute!

00:23:04.650 --> 00:23:06.290
Yes, yes!

00:23:06.290 --> 00:23:07.780
I really was, wasn't I?

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:15.400
Desumi-chan, take care of my Fudo.

00:23:16.510 --> 00:23:17.460
I will!

00:23:20.650 --> 00:23:24.930
Secret Society Gekko has a combatant 
cafeteria and dormitory facilities.

00:23:24.930 --> 00:23:28.210
A mentorship system helps 
to guide the inexperienced.

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:30.810
We treasure individuality in our work force

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:33.850
as we work together to 
achieve world domination!

00:23:33.490 --> 00:23:40.250
Episode 6    As Long as We're at the Beach...

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:36.490
Next time: "As Long as We're at the Beach..."

00:23:36.240 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Secret Society Gekko</b>

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:39.530
We'll be waiting for your resumes!
